{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/consultations/modified-proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove","content_id":"20016dee-91b8-4dad-97ae-10370e2ef8e1","description":"This consultation seeks views on a potential modification to a proposal for local government reorganisation in East Sussex and Brighton and Hove.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9408318","isbn":"","title":"Modified proposals for local government reorganisation in East Sussex and Brighton and Hove","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/consultations/modified-proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove/modified-proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":286837,"filename":"Modified_proposals_for_East_Sussex_and_Brighton_and_Hove_-_Summary_and_analysis_of_consultation_responses.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9408324","isbn":"","number_of_pages":16,"title":"Modified proposals for East Sussex and Brighton and Hove: Summary and analysis of consultation responses","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a60ebb2f869f6a53d0c8a8e/Modified_proposals_for_East_Sussex_and_Brighton_and_Hove_-_Summary_and_analysis_of_consultation_responses.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>We are seeking views on potential modification to the 2 unitary proposal for the reorganisation of local government in East Sussex and Brighton and Hove.</p>\n\n<p>The 2 unitary proposal was submitted by:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>East Sussex County Council</li>\n  <li>Eastbourne Borough Council</li>\n  <li>Hastings Borough Council</li>\n  <li>Lewes District Council</li>\n  <li>Rother District Council   </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>​​Responses to this consultation will inform the Secretary of State’s decision on which proposal, if any, to implement.​</p>\n\n<div role=\"note\" aria-label=\"Information\" class=\"application-notice info-notice\">\n  <p>View our first consultation on <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove-and-west-sussex\">local government reorganisation in East Sussex and Brighton and Hove, and West Sussex</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Summary and analysis of consultation responses added.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-22T16:21:58Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-12T09:08:00Z"}],"closing_date":"2026-06-15T23:59:00.000+01:00","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9408318"],"final_outcome_attachments":["9408324"],"final_outcome_detail":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The Secretary of State for Housing, Communities and Local Government has decided to implement, subject to Parliamentary approval, the proposal for 2 unitary councils to be established in East Sussex and Brighton and Hove.</p>\n\n<p>This proposal was submitted by:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>East Sussex County Council</li>\n  <li>Eastbourne Borough Council</li>\n  <li>Hastings Borough Council</li>\n  <li>Lewes District Council</li>\n  <li>Rother District Council</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The Secretary of State will exercise the power to modify the proposal to achieve the boundary change requested by Brighton and Hove City Council, with the exception of Falmer Parish.</p>\n</div>","first_public_at":"2026-05-12T10:08:00.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","a